---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content'; import ActivityGrid from '../components/ActivityGrid.astro'; import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro'; import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'; import Header from '../components/Header.astro'; import FormattedDate from '../components/FormattedDate.astro'; import {SITE_TITLE,SITE_DESCRIPTION} from '../consts';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,''); const posts=(await getCollection('blog',({data})=>!data.draft)).sort((a,b)=>b.data.pubDate.valueOf()-a.data.pubDate.valueOf()).slice(0,3);
---
<html lang="ko"><head><BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}/></head><body><Header/><main><section class="hero"><h1>Data<br/>Analyst</h1><div class="intro"><p>데이터 속에서 의도와 법칙을 찾는 분석가 신재원입니다.</p><a href={`${base}/about`}>More about me ↗</a></div></section><section class="work"><div class="side"><span>SELECTED WORK</span><p>질문에서 시작해 데이터로 답을 찾습니다.</p></div><div class="items"><a href={`${base}/projects#mobility`}><div><small>01 / DATA ANALYSIS</small><h2>서울 지하철과<br/>따릉이 이용 관계</h2><p>서로 다른 교통 데이터를 결합해 도시 이동 패턴을 탐색했습니다.</p></div><b>↗</b></a><a href={`${base}/projects#network-attack`}><div><small>02 / MACHINE LEARNING</small><h2>네트워크 공격<br/>유형 분류</h2><p>시간 누수를 통제하고 높은 탐지율을 유지하면서 정상 트래픽의 오경보를 줄였습니다.</p></div><b>↗</b></a><a href={`${base}/projects#ship-paint-quality`}><div><small>03 / COMPUTER VISION</small><h2>선박 도장 품질<br/>결함 분류</h2><p>학습 조건과 앙상블 구성을 재점검해 5개 품질 클래스의 Macro F1을 개선했습니다.</p></div><b>↗</b></a><div class="method"><small>04 / PROCESS</small><h2>Question<br/>to Insight</h2><ol><li>질문 정의</li><li>데이터 정제</li><li>탐색과 검증</li><li>인사이트 전달</li></ol></div></div></section><section class="notes"><div><span>LATEST NOTES</span><h2>Analysis<br/>Journal</h2></div><div>{posts.map(post=><a href={`${base}/blog/${post.id}/`}><time><FormattedDate date={post.data.pubDate}/></time><span>{post.data.title}</span><b>↗</b></a>)}<a class="all" href={`${base}/blog`}>View all notes</a></div></section><ActivityGrid/></main><Footer/></body></html>
<style>.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:520px;padding:65px 0 120px}.hero h1{align-self:start}.intro{align-self:center;max-width:420px;font-size:1.45rem}.intro a{display:inline-block;margin-top:35px;font-size:.85rem}.work,.notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;padding:60px 0 120px;border-top:1px solid #111;gap:50px}.side span,.notes>div>span{font-size:.62rem;font-weight:bold}.side p{margin-top:25px;max-width:250px}.items>a,.method{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:18px 0 28px;border-top:1px solid #111;color:#111;text-decoration:none}.items small,.method small{font-size:.58rem}.items h2,.method h2{font-size:2.5rem;margin:25px 0}.items p{max-width:480px}.method{display:block}.method ol{padding:0;list-style:none}.method li{padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #aaa}.notes>div:first-child h2{margin-top:35px}.notes>div:last-child>a:not(.all){display:grid;grid-template-columns:100px 1fr 20px;padding:15px 0;border-top:1px solid #111;text-decoration:none}.notes time{font-size:.68rem}.all{display:inline-block;margin-top:30px}@media(max-width:700px){.hero,.work,.notes{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.hero{min-height:auto;padding-bottom:80px}.intro{font-size:1.2rem}.work,.notes{padding-bottom:80px}.items h2,.method h2{font-size:2rem}}</style>
